Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.87,0:00:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醫生 你在聽我說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 我在想今晚做什麼菜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 是你讓我告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才來跟你商量的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東京區域蔓延的對被詛咒的孩子的歧視
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有昨天延珠的身世在學校曝光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因而產生的對今後生活的不安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的煩惱太過平常 簡直無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.29,0:00:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這不是在聽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.27,0:00:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說到底 人類為什麼非得殲滅原腸動物不可？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.27,0:00:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(561,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為它們是人類之敵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界上也存在將原腸動物視為淨化地球而出現的神的使者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.43,0:00:50.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將它們神聖化的宗教團體
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用他們的話來說 人類才是耗盡資源 破壞地球的元兇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那終究只是宣揚人類無用的極端言論吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果原腸動物是神的使者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(379,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.35,0:01:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼被詛咒的孩子又算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類和原腸動物之間的信差
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(393,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是神的代理人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠是人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:17.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一個擁有獨立人格和意志的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不是其他什麼別的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.99,0:01:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是如此 你不是很清楚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說 蓮太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.53,0:01:32.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你尚且知道自己來自何方 這已經不錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠連這都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.77,0:01:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外圍區的那些被詛咒的孩子 幾乎都是棄兒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們不知父母是誰 也不瞭解外面的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.33,0:01:47.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知被多少人投以輕蔑的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,支撐 教育和引導著她們的 又是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.74,0:01:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不是家人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醫生 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 你的贊助者有話讓我轉告你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她叫你偶爾也去學生會室玩玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是裏見先生嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.66,0:02:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:25.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是藍原同學的班主任
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…從今天早上開始藍原同學來上課了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我馬上就到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.51,0:04:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,400)\pos(205,388)\fsp4\bord0}#03 命運的孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.76,0:04:14.75,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,別來學校啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:15.80,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼還在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:16.48,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,別過來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:17.12,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.35,0:04:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該死的原腸動物 就是因為你們四處屠殺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.35,0:04:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.5,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:22.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是人家做的 人家是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:30.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠 轉學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家…不想…輸…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.07,0:04:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明已經交了那麼多朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:05:01.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們已經不是你的朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:04.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使如此 我們也必須戰鬥下去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見 已經知道感染源原腸動物的潛伏地點了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(469.5,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要第一個趕去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是這樣 用救護直升機也太…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我挪用了明年的學費
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是讓別人搶了先 我就得退學了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是原腸動物…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(422.5,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.53,0:05:41.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說確實存在把巢編成降落傘的形狀並借此移動的蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然能憑藉類似的原理…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此 這就是醫生所說的原創能力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 延珠！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,降低高度！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.91,0:06:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:28.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:46.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.41,0:06:49.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎 人家擊敗它了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家擊敗它了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 人家戰鬥了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家保護了學校的同學們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有我在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或許現在只能繼續戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.20,0:07:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也理解你不知該何去何從的不安心情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 延珠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還有我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我對你的珍惜 不會輸給任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算世界不接受你 我也會永遠陪伴在你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 蓮太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 快點回收它 然後回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面到底裝著什麼東西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是七星的遺物嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:07:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一種不祥的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了 裏見
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到延珠了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.69,0:08:21.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天童式戰鬥術一型八號「焰火扇」！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你見識一下我的招式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「最強之痛」！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:58.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠 快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:05.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我 蓮太郎！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 延珠逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:16.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想殺掉她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.87,0:09:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 我的女兒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是讓他們和其他民警會合的話 事情會變得麻煩的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先把工作完成吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太弱了 太弱了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼遺言嗎 即將死亡的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下地獄去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是裏見蓮太郎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.39,0:10:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一件事希望你做出選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.11,0:10:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木更小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:32.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎回來 裏見
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:35.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…睡了多久
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概睡了整整一天又三個小時
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,據說你的心臟在手術的最後關頭開始跳動了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒有放棄生存
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.47,0:10:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政府方面把情報傳達給我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:11:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影胤帶走的箱子裡裝有能召喚階段Ⅴ原腸動物的觸媒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:11:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(614,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.73,0:11:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,階段Ⅴ？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…毀滅世界的十一隻…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.19,0:11:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原腸動物從階段Ⅰ開始 經過階段Ⅱ和階段Ⅲ的成長
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.19,0:11:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(152,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在階段Ⅳ成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.99,0:11:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,階段Ⅴ則在它的進化範圍之外
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從十年前原腸動物誕生時起便存在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(377,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比任何原腸動物都巨大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(421,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絲毫不受錵磁場的影響
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(407,437)\fs21}Varanium
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.69,0:11:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,階段Ⅴ曾經破壞過數個地區的巨石碑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他原腸動物一同入侵 引發的則是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(301,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.80,0:11:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「大滅絕」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛭子影胤現在逃到了巨石碑外面的「未探查領域」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.69,0:11:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始進行召喚階段Ⅴ的準備
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由政府主導的大規模追擊作戰即將開始
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.57,0:11:52.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是不能阻止他們 東京區域就會…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:57.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去嗎 有勝算嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:11:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須贏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.51,0:12:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你會死的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經做好覺悟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實現在的你需要絕對的靜養
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:13.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 木更小姐 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起我還有更需要你去道歉的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:23.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼時候…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自從你被抬進來 她就一直守在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.15,0:12:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎 笨蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:36.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你擔心了 延珠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.18,0:12:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找你的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聖天子大人的電話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:12:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛭子影胤的追擊作戰已經開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.75,0:13:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能參加這次的作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.32,0:13:05.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼是我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於這一點 你自己應該是最清楚的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:11.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.40,0:13:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別忘了這可不是為了你們做的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好運 裏見先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.09,0:13:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是你的贊助者給你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.00,0:13:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:31.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要謝就幹出點功績吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.61,0:13:34.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我給你的餞別禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,AGV實驗性藥物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果可以的話最好別用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.63,0:13:42.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在失去意識的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我夢見了十年前被你做手術的事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我對你所做的事 無論說什麼都無法被原諒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從那天開始
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從來沒有怨恨過你一次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以社長的身份命令你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擊破影胤小比奈組合
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:16.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止階段Ⅴ的召喚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要為了我比之前努力百倍地工作
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我會比你更加努力千倍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.71,0:14:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定會阻止他們的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是為了你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.60,0:15:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好險…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:54.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 是哪對搭檔使用了爆炸物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:01.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎 那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.81,0:16:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,階段Ⅳ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.37,0:16:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延珠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.78,0:17:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不許動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.96,0:17:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.87,0:17:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 延珠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.36,0:17:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙不是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還記得我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.63,0:17:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 人家可不認識這個女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:26.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們究竟是什麼關係給人家說清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是一位叫伊熊將監的促進者的搭檔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(524,437)\fs21}Promoter
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是起始者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(437,437)\fs21}Initiator
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.28,0:17:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫千壽夏世
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.67,0:17:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.72,0:17:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 人家才不會認可那個女人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 只是讓她出去把風 幹嘛那麼不高興
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為原因是顯而易見的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得我很不可思議嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:56.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是具備海豚因子的起始者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(557,437)\fs21}Initiator
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不過擁有比普通人更高的智商和記憶力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由頭腦派的你來做後衛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將監則是前鋒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.25,0:18:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是少見的組合呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將監先生連大腦都是肌肉構成的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:16.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像後援這種瑣碎的事情他是做不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我看看你的槍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我說不給呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.59,0:18:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你對被救之事毫無感謝之意的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我學到了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在要求回報的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,善行便已經墮落了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼在森林裡使用爆炸物？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.33,0:18:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們發現森林深處有閃爍的燈光 中了陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們以為是民警 便加以接近
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果那是原腸動物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(482,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們馬上使用了榴彈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.27,0:18:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後就被森林中的原腸動物襲擊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.27,0:18:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(512,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我與將監先生走散了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被原腸動物注射體液了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(348,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被注入的體液只有極少的量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:09.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有侵蝕率上升的癥狀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心我會原腸動物化
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(496,437)\fs21}Gastrea
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.18,0:19:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽著 回去以後一定要仔細檢查
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是在擔心我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我稍微有些羨慕延珠小姐了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想必延珠小姐沒有殺過人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.49,0:19:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看她的眼睛就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你殺過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.99,0:19:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在來這裡的途中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將遇到的民警搭檔殺掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是將監先生的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說不會將消滅面具混蛋的功勞讓給任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.42,0:19:51.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手在顫抖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:53.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.47,0:19:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想很快就會習慣的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:57.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.85,0:20:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殺人的最恐怖之處就在於習慣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殺人之後 知道自己不會受到懲罰的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人便會逐漸忘卻什麼是罪惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你曾殺過人 所以才這麼說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.72,0:20:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生有著不可思議的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.81,0:20:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定有著複雜的過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的表情明明那麼溫柔 卻又十分可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在自以為是地胡說些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.78,0:20:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 忘掉剛才的話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼道歉？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.84,0:20:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生說的話是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:43.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在很奇怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明馬上就能想到數十個反駁你的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我卻不願否定你所說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的心情…還是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.07,0:21:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 還活著的話就回答我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您沒事就好 將監先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏世 有個好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.53,0:21:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到面具混蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然還是要去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他雖然是那種人 也仍然是我的搭檔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:21.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.05,0:21:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除將監之外還有十組以上的民警搭檔在進行攻擊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算只能看到戰鬥的結果 我也要親眼見證到最後
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裏見先生 你知道那是什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.43,0:21:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是「天梯」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.15,0:21:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是殺戮兵器的代表
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是被掠奪的世代的憎惡的象徵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.33,0:21:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的時代
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在所發生的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.95,0:21:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是穩固的復興嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:21:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影胤在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:40.02,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fsp4\be4\bord2}#04  黑色的子彈
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓮太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.72,0:23:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有蓮太郎能拯救世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.65,0:23:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是其他任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有蓮太郎…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.47,0:22:32.95,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}初めはいつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.23,0:22:35.92,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}期待を止められない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:41.40,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}けれどやがて諦めを覚える
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:44.30,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}今を守る盾を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:47.29,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}薬莢に詰め込んで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:50.78,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}円く壁を切り取った
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.99,0:22:54.97,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}のぞけば
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.40,0:23:02.87,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}終わりが見返してた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:08.87,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}激しい黒に包まれた君の
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.35,0:23:12.12,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}哀情でも心傷でも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.19,0:23:14.89,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}全部取り込んで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:17.78,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}それすら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:20.36,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}僕の糧にしてみせるさ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.45,0:23:23.14,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}like a lotus
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.61,0:23:24.91,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}だからずっと
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:27.62,EDJ,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}傍にいて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.47,0:22:32.95,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}最初無論何時
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.23,0:22:35.92,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}都無法停止期待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:41.40,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}但我最終學會放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.82,0:22:44.30,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}將守護現在的盾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:47.29,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}滿滿地裝入彈殼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:50.78,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}擊穿高牆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.99,0:22:54.97,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}向外窺探
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.40,0:23:02.87,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}才發現終點正向我回望
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:08.87,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}連那包裹在濃烈黑色中的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.35,0:23:12.12,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}你的悲哀與心傷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.19,0:23:14.89,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}我都悉數納入懷中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:17.78,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}即使這些
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.96,0:23:20.36,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}我也要將它們變成我的食糧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.45,0:23:23.14,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}like a lotus
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.61,0:23:24.91,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}所以請你一直
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:27.62,EDC,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be7}陪伴在我身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:51.11,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}ひび割れ　壊れゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:54.23,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}世界は果てしなく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:57.29,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}未知なる創造が
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:03:00.32,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}今秩序をなくしてる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:03.69,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}重ね合う痛みが
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:06.79,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}繰り返す現実
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:09.72,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}君との毎日が
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:13.01,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}その闇に身を投げた
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:16.00,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}指し示した道を
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:19.21,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}輝かせたいから
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:25.08,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}黒いこの銃弾が今すべてを撃ちぬく
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:28.28,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}赤く燃える　その眼差しに
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:31.34,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}熱く響く　命の鼓動を
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:36.01,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}強く深く　貫いてゆく　真実を
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:40.64,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}傷だらけの心を抱いて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.77,0:03:43.67,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}ずっと明日を引き寄せるから
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:48.50,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}この体にすべてを込めて戦うよ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:53.71,ED-J,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}希望を信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:51.11,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}世界無休止地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:54.23,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}變得粉碎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.52,0:02:57.29,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}未知的創造
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:03:00.32,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}正在破壞著秩序
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:03.69,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}累積的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:06.79,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}就是重複的現實
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:09.72,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}和你度過的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:13.01,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}都投身於這黑暗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:16.00,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}因為想要照亮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:19.21,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}指引的路途
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:25.08,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}現在我將用這枚黑色的子彈 擊穿一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:28.28,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}火紅燃燒　為你的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:31.34,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}熱烈奏響  生命的心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:36.01,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}強烈深邃地貫穿真實
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:40.64,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}懷抱佈滿傷痕的心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.77,0:03:43.67,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}因為想要永遠擁抱明天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:48.50,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}我將身負一切 戰鬥下去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:53.71,ED-C,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be4}相信著希望
